c>that </c><00:00:09.712><c>so </c><00:00:09.713><c>in </c><00:00:09.714><c>conclusion </c><00:00:09.715><c>among </c><00:00:09.716><c>patients  </c><00:00:09.717><c>recently </c><00:00:09.718><c>hospitalized </c><00:00:09.719><c>for </c><00:00:09.720><c>heart </c><00:00:09.721><c>failure  </c><00:00:09.722><c>telemonitoring </c><00:00:09.723><c>didn't </c><00:00:09.724><c>improve </c><00:00:09.725><c>outcomes  </c><00:00:09.726><c>and </c><00:00:09.727><c>our </c><00:00:09.728><c>results </c><00:00:09.729><c>indicate </c><00:00:09.730><c>the </c><00:00:09.731><c>importance  </c><00:00:09.732><c>of </c><00:00:09.733><c>a </c><00:00:09.734><c>thorough </c><00:00:09.735><c>and </c><00:00:09.736><c>independent </c><00:00:09.737><c>evaluation  </c><00:00:09.738><c>of </c><00:00:09.739><c>disease </c><00:00:09.740><c>management </c><00:00:09.741><c>strategies </c><00:00:09.742><c>before  </c><00:00:09.743><c>widespread </c><00:00:09.744><c>adoption</c>

